# Dropdown

Use Dropdown for a short list of actions or links. Set `align="end"` to align it with the trigger's right edge. Items with `href` are links; other items are buttons.

Add nested `items` for submenus. Use Command Menu instead when people need to search through many actions.

Arrow keys, Home, and End navigate items; Escape closes the menu. On touch devices, a submenu replaces the current list, and Back returns to it.

Menus are modal by default: a transparent backdrop blocks background interaction, outside clicks only dismiss the menu, and focus stays inside until selection or Escape. Set `modal={false}` in Svelte or `modal="false"` in HTML to allow outside interaction. In non-modal mode, Tab closes the menu and moves to the next control.

Set `error` to mark the trigger as invalid.

To limit a long menu's height, set `contentStyle="--aesir-dropdown-max-height: 20rem"`.

<DocsExample title="Dropdown" source={dropdownExampleSource} htmlSource={dropdownExampleHtmlSource}><DropdownExample /></DocsExample>

## Layout options

In HTML, `width="full"` stretches the trigger wrapper. Give the slotted button `width="full"` too if it should fill the wrapper.

Compact menus remain aligned with their trigger on small screens. Set `mobile-layout="full"` for a viewport-width menu; `mobile-breakpoint` defaults to 640px. In Svelte, use `mobileLayout` and `mobileBreakpoint`.

For HTML customization, use `match-viewport-width`, `content-class`, `content-style`, or the `anchor`, `content`, and `label` CSS parts.

## Item schema

- `label` and `value` identify an item.
- `items` creates a submenu.
- `type: 'label'` creates a group heading; `type: 'separator'` divides groups.
- `icon`, `shortcut`, `disabled`, `variant`, `role`, and `checked` configure presentation and state.
- `href`, `target`, and `rel` create a native link item; otherwise the item is a button.
- `action` and `onselect` run only for terminal items, not submenu triggers.

The HTML element accepts the same nested structure as JSON:

```html
<aesir-dropdown
	items='[{"type":"label","label":"Document"},{"value":"create","label":"Create","items":[{"value":"from-template","label":"From template","items":[{"value":"report","label":"Report"}]}]},{"type":"separator"},{"value":"submit","label":"Submit"}]'
>
	<aesir-button>Menu</aesir-button>
</aesir-dropdown>
```
